From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 15:43:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(skills): narrow gate anchors to command form (avoid
 SonarCloud collision)

Round-4 (Codex): bare 'gate status'/'gate check' anchors outranked the sonarcloud
skill for quality-gate questions ('SonarCloud gate status' -> gates). Dropped the
bare forms; keep 'forge gate check'/'forge gate status' command anchors ('forge
gate' already covers both). Verified 'SonarCloud gate status' -> sonarcloud,
'check the quality gate' -> sonarcloud, 'forge gate check/status' -> gates.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
